      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds like a good reward for creator competitions such as the recently closed Halloween contest submissions. They probably shouldn't show on nameplates to avoid more of the psychological issues that the ranking system itself introduced. It would be cool to see on full user profiles, since that data is generally obfuscated behind additional clicks, or manual searches of player's usernames.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
