      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Terrible idea. You'll get spam friend requests more often. And you'll have people AFKing just to get hours.\n\nNo badges or awards or anything. The rank system is already enough to split the playerbase. Let's not have anything more than that, I don't want to have someone run up to my face yelling \"HAY LOOK I HAV THIS FRIENDS BADGE COZ I HAVE OVER A THOUSAND FRIENDS\".\n\nNo. Just no.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
